#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:17
msgid "Project Monitor"
msgstr "Monitor projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:24
msgid "Project Monitor elements"
msgstr "Prvky monitora projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Project Monitor displays your project's :term:`timeline` - i.e. the "
"edited version of your video. It has the same functions and options as the :"
"ref:`ui-monitors_clip_monitor` except for the |edit-mode| icon which "
"switches :term:`Edit Mode` on or off."
msgstr ""
"Monitor projektu zobrazuje :term:`timeline` vášho projektu – t. j. editovanú "
"verziu vášho videa. Má rovnaké funkcie a možnosti ako :ref:`ui-"
"monitors_clip_monitor` s výnimkou ikony |edit-mode|, ktorá zapína alebo "
"vypína :term:`Edit Mode`."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:28
msgid ""
"For more details about the icons in the monitor toolbar refer to :ref:`this "
"section <ui_elements-monitor_icons>` of the manual."
msgstr ""
"Ďalšie podrobnosti o ikonách na paneli nástrojov monitora nájdete v :ref:"
"`tejto časti <ui_elements-monitor_icons>` príručky."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:34
msgid "Project Monitor Controls"
msgstr "Ovládacie prvky monitora projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:36
msgid ""
"The position caret. Shows the current location in the project relative to "
"the whole project. You can click and drag this to move the position in the "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Pozičný kurzor. Zobrazuje aktuálnu polohu v projekte vzhľadom na celý "
"projekt. Kliknutím a pretiahnutím ho môžete presunúť na inú pozíciu v "
"projekte."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:38
msgid ""
"The timecode control. You can type a timecode here and press :kbd:`Enter` to "
"bring the playhead to an exact location."
msgstr ""
"Ovládací prvok časového kódu. Tu môžete zadať časový kód a stlačením :kbd:"
"`Enter` presunúť prehrávací kurzor na presnú polohu."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:40
msgid ""
"Timecode control arrows. You can move the Project Monitor one frame at a "
"time with these. Alternatively, you can use :kbd:`left` and :kbd:`right` "
"(keyboard arrow keys)."
msgstr ""
"Šípky ovládania časového kódu. Pomocou nich môžete pohybovať monitorom "
"projektu po jednom snímku. Prípadne môžete použiť :kbd:`left` a :kbd:`right` "
"(klávesové šípky)."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:46
msgid "Hamburger Menu"
msgstr "Menu hamburgeru"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:53
msgid "Project Monitor options"
msgstr "Možnosti monitora projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Volume** - Set the Project Monitor playback volume. This does not affect "
"the master volume setting."
msgstr ""
"**Hlasitosť** – Nastavte hlasitosť prehrávania monitora projektu. Toto "
"neovplyvňuje nastavenie hlavnej hlasitosti."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Go to Timeine Marker** - If :term:`timeline markers <Timeline Marker "
"(former Guide)>` are defined the list of timeline markers is displayed and "
"selecting one positions the :term:`playhead` at the guide's timecode."
msgstr ""
"**Prejsť na marker časovej osi** – Ak sú definované :term:`markery časovej "
"osi <Timeline Marker (former Guide)>`, zobrazí sa ich zoznam a výberom "
"jedného z nich sa :term:`prehrávací kurzor` presunie na časový kód daného "
"vodiaca."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Force Monitor Size** - You can force the Project Monitor to display the "
"video at 100% (original size), 50% or adjust it to the Project Monitor "
"widget's size."
msgstr ""
"**Vynútiť veľkosť monitora** – Môžete prinútiť monitor projektu zobrazovať "
"video na 100 % (pôvodná veľkosť), 50 % alebo ho prispôsobiť veľkosti widgetu "
"monitora projektu."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Set current image as thumbnail** - Takes the a snapshot of the current "
"frame and uses that as the thumbnail for the clip."
msgstr ""
"**Nastaviť aktuálny obrázok ako miniatúru** – Zachytí snímku aktuálneho "
"snímku a použije ju ako miniatúru klipu."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Audio Scrubbing** - If enabled plays the audio track while scrubbing "
"through the timeline. You may want to turn this off to improve scrubbing "
"performance or if the noise is distracting."
msgstr ""
"**Zvukové prehľadávanie** – Ak je povolené, prehráva zvukovú stopu pri "
"prehľadávaní časovej osi. Možno ho budete chcieť vypnúť na zlepšenie výkonu "
"prehľadávania alebo ak vás hluk rozptyľuje."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Show Audio Levels** - If enabled shows the frequency curve of the master "
"audio in the Project Monitor."
msgstr ""
"**Zobraziť úrovne zvuku** – Ak je povolené, zobrazuje frekvenčnú krivku "
"hlavného zvuku v monitore projektu."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:73
msgid "Creating Zones"
msgstr "Vytváranie zón"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:80
msgid "Project Monitor zone"
msgstr "Zóna monitora projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:82
msgid ""
"You can use the :kbd:`I` and :kbd:`O` keys or the |zone-in| and |zone-out| "
"icons to create a zone in the Project Monitor the same way you make zones in "
"the Clip Monitor with the notable exception that the zone defined in the "
"Project Monitor also sets the zone in the :term:`Timeline`. The zone will be "
"indicated by a colored bar both on the :term:`timeline` and underneath the "
"Project Monitor."
msgstr ""
"Môžete použiť klávesy :kbd:`I` a :kbd:`O` alebo ikony |zone-in| a |zone-out| "
"na vytvorenie zóny v monitore projektu rovnako, ako vytvárate zóny v "
"monitore klipov, s tým rozdielom, že zóna definovaná v monitore projektu "
"tiež nastavuje zónu v :term:`Timeline`. Zóna bude naznačená farebným pruhom "
"na :term:`timeline` aj pod monitorom projektu."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:86
msgid ""
"You can have Kdenlive only render the selected zone - see :ref:`rendering-"
"selected_zone`."
msgstr ""
"Môžete nechať Kdenlive renderovať iba vybranú zónu – pozri :ref:`rendering-"
"selected_zone`."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:92
msgid "Right-click Menu"
msgstr "Ponuka pravého tlačidla"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:101
msgid "Project Monitor right-click menu options"
msgstr "Možnosti kontextového menu monitora projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:103
msgid ""
"These are the menu items that are available when you right-click in the "
"Project Monitor. These actions affect the clip that is currently selected in "
"the :ref:`timeline`. Similar menu items are available from a right-click "
"menu in the :ref:`ui-monitors_clip_monitor`. However, the clip monitor menu "
"items affect the currently selected clip in the :doc:`project bin </"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin>`."
msgstr ""
"Toto sú položky menu, ktoré sú dostupné po kliknutí pravým tlačidlom myši v "
"monitore projektu. Tieto akcie ovplyvňujú klip, ktorý je aktuálne vybratý "
"na :ref:`timeline`. Podobné položky menu sú dostupné z kontextového menu v :"
"ref:`ui-monitors_clip_monitor`. Položky menu monitora klipov však ovplyvňujú "
"aktuálne vybratý klip v :doc:`koši projektu </project_and_asset_management/"
"project_bin>`."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:115
msgid "Item"
msgstr "Položka"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:116
msgid "Shortcut"
msgstr "Skratka"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:117
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:118
msgid "Play"
msgstr "Prehrať"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:119
msgid ":kbd:`Space` or click into the monitor"
msgstr ":kbd:`Space` alebo kliknutie do monitora"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:120
msgid ""
"Plays the :term:`clip` currently selected in the :term:`project bin`. (:doc:"
"`Disable play on click in the settings </getting_started/configure_kdenlive/"
"configuration_playback>`)"
msgstr ""
"Prehrá :term:`klip` aktuálne vybratý v :term:`project bin`. (:doc:`Zakázať "
"prehrávanie po kliknutí v nastaveniach</getting_started/configure_kdenlive/"
"configuration_playback>`)"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:121
msgid "Play Zone"
msgstr "Prehrať zónu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:122
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl+Space`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl+Space`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:123
msgid "Plays the current :term:`zone` and stops"
msgstr "Prehrá aktuálnu :term:`zónu` a zastaví"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:124
msgid "Loop Zone"
msgstr "Opakovať v slučke zónu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:125
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+Space`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+Space`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:126
msgid "Plays the current :term:`zone` in a continuous loop"
msgstr "Prehrá aktuálnu :term:`zónu` v nepretržitej slučke"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:127
msgid "Play Zone From Cursor"
msgstr "Prehrať zónu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:129
msgid ""
"Plays the current :term:`zone` from cursor to the end of the :term:`zone`"
msgstr "Prehrá aktuálnu :term:`zónu` od kurzora do konca :term:`zóny`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:130
msgid "Loop Selected Clip"
msgstr "Opakovať v slučke vybraný klip"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:132
msgid "Plays the currently selected :term:`clip` in a continuous loop"
msgstr "Prehrá aktuálne vybratý :term:`klip` v nepretržitej slučke"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:133
msgid "Go to Project Start"
msgstr "Prejsť na začiatok projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:134
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl+Home`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl+Home`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:135
msgid "Goes to the beginning of the clip"
msgstr "Prejde na začiatok klipu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:136
msgid "Go to Previous Guide"
msgstr "Prejsť na predchádzajúci vodiac"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:137
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl+Left`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl+Left`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:138
msgid "Goes to the previous :term:`Timeline Marker (former Guide)`"
msgstr "Prejde na predchádzajúci :term:`Timeline Marker (former Guide)`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:139
msgid "Go to Previous Snap Point"
msgstr "Prejsť na predchádzajúcu zarážku"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:140
msgid ":kbd:`Alt+Left`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Alt+Left`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:141
msgid "Moves the :term:`playhead` to the previous :term:`snap point`"
msgstr ""
"Presunie :term:`prehrávací kurzor` na predchádzajúci :term:`bod prichytenia`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:142
msgid "Go to Zone Start"
msgstr "Prejsť na začiatok zóny"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:143
msgid ":kbd:`Shift+I`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift+I`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:144
msgid "Goes to the start of the :term:`zone`"
msgstr "Prejde na začiatok :term:`zóny`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:145
msgid "Go to Clip Start"
msgstr "Prejsť na začiatok klipu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:146
msgid ":kbd:`Home`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Home`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:147
msgid "Moves the clip playhead to the beginning of the clip"
msgstr "Presunie prehrávací kurzor klipu na začiatok klipu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:148
msgid "Go to Clip End"
msgstr "Prejsť na koniec klipu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:149
msgid ":kbd:`End`"
msgstr ":kbd:`End`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:150
msgid "Moves the clip playhead to the end of the clip"
msgstr "Presunie prehrávací kurzor klipu na koniec klipu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:151
msgid "Go to Zone End"
msgstr "Prejsť na koniec zóny"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:152
msgid ":kbd:`Shift+O`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift+O`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:153
msgid "Goes to the end of the :term:`zone`"
msgstr "Prejde na koniec :term:`zóny`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:154
msgid "Go to Next Snap Point"
msgstr "Prejsť na nasledujúcu zarážku"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:155
msgid ":kbd:`Alt+Right`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Alt+Right`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:156
msgid "Moves the :term:`playhead` to the next :term:`snap point`"
msgstr ""
"Presunie :term:`prehrávací kurzor` na nasledujúci :term:`bod prichytenia`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:157
msgid "Go to Next Guide"
msgstr "Prejsť na nasledujúci vodiac"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:158
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl+Right`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl+Right`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:159
msgid "Goes to the next :term:`Timeline Marker (former Guide)`"
msgstr "Prejde na nasledujúci :term:`Timeline Marker (former Guide)`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:160
msgid "Go to Project End"
msgstr "Prejsť na koniec projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:161
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl+End`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl+End`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:162
msgid "Goes the end of the clip"
msgstr "Prejde na koniec klipu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:163
msgid "Go to Guide..."
msgstr "Prejsť na vodiac..."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:165
msgid ""
"The menu item pops out a list of existing :term:`Timeline Marker <Timeline "
"Marker (former Guide)>` to select from. When one is selected the playhead "
"moves to that guide."
msgstr ""
"Táto položka menu zobrazí zoznam existujúcich :term:`markerov časovej osi "
"<Timeline Marker (former Guide)>` na výber. Po výbere jedného z nich sa "
"prehrávací kurzor presunie na daný vodiac."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:166
msgid "Extract Frame"
msgstr "Extrahovať snímok"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:168
msgid ""
"Opens the **Save Image** dialog window to save the current frame as an image "
"file (default is :file:`.png`) to your file system"
msgstr ""
"Otvorí dialógové okno **Uložiť obrázok** na uloženie aktuálneho snímku ako "
"obrazového súboru (predvolene :file:`.png`) do vášho súborového systému"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:169
msgid "Extract Frame to Project"
msgstr "Extrahovať snímok do projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:171
msgid ""
"Same as :guilabel:`Extract Frame` but in addition the image file is brought "
"into the project bin"
msgstr ""
"Rovnaké ako :guilabel:`Extract Frame`, ale navyše sa obrazový súbor pridá do "
"koša projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:177
msgid "Save Image dialog for extracting frames"
msgstr "Dialóg Uložiť obrázok na extrakciu snímkov"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:184
msgid "Add Project Note"
msgstr "Pridať poznámku projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:186
msgid ""
"Opens the :doc:`Project Notes </project_and_asset_management/project_notes>` "
"widget and adds a hyperlink to the current frame in the clip. You can enter "
"more text to describe the scene."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí widget :doc:`Poznámky projektu </project_and_asset_management/"
"project_notes>` a pridá hypertextový odkaz na aktuálny snímok v klipe. "
"Môžete zadať ďalší text na opis scény."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:187
msgid "Set Zone In"
msgstr "Nastaviť zónu vnútri"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:188
msgid ":kbd:`I`"
msgstr ":kbd:`I`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:189
msgid "Sets the :term:`in-point` for the :term:`zone`"
msgstr "Nastaví :term:`vstupný bod` pre :term:`zónu`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:190
msgid "Set Zone Out"
msgstr "Nastaviť zónu von"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:191
msgid ":kbd:`O`"
msgstr ":kbd:`O`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:192
msgid "Sets the :term:`out-point` for the :term:`zone`"
msgstr "Nastaví :term:`výstupný bod` pre :term:`zónu`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:193
msgid "Set current image as thumbnail"
msgstr "Nastaviť súčasný obrázok ako náhľad"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:195
msgid "Uses the current frame as the thumbnail for the clip in the project bin"
msgstr "Použije aktuálny snímok ako miniatúru klipu v koši projektu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:196
#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:219
msgid "Multitrack View"
msgstr "Viacstopový pohľad"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:197
msgid ":kbd:`F12`"
msgstr ":kbd:`F12`"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:198
msgid ""
"Switches the project monitor area to the :ref:`ui-"
"monitors_pm_multitrack_view`. All active tracks will be displayed. For more "
"details about how to use this in Editing refer to the :ref:`multicam_tool` "
"chapter."
msgstr ""
"Prepne oblasť monitora projektu na :ref:`ui-monitors_pm_multitrack_view`. "
"Zobrazia sa všetky aktívne stopy. Ďalšie podrobnosti o použití pri editácii "
"nájdete v kapitole :ref:`multicam_tool`."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:199
msgid "Current Monitor Overlay"
msgstr "Aktuálne prekrytie monitora"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:201
msgid "Opens a fly-out for the various available monitor overlays"
msgstr "Otvorí rozbaľovaciu ponuku rôznych dostupných prekryvov monitora"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:202
msgid "Monitor Info Overlay"
msgstr "Monitor Info Overlay"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:204
msgid "Switches all monitor overlays on or off"
msgstr "Zapne alebo vypne všetky prekryvy monitora"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:205
msgid "Monitor Overlay Timecode"
msgstr "Prekrytie monitora časový kód"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:207
msgid "Switches the display of the timecode on or off"
msgstr "Zapne alebo vypne zobrazenie časového kódu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:208
msgid "Monitor Overlay Playback FPS"
msgstr "Monitorovať FPS prehrávania"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:210
msgid "Switches the display of the frame-per-seconds (:term:`fps`) on or off"
msgstr "Zapne alebo vypne zobrazenie snímkov za sekundu (:term:`fps`)"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:211
msgid "Monitor Overlay Markers"
msgstr "Prekrytie monitora označníky"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:213
msgid "Switches the display of the marker lines and thumbnails on or off"
msgstr "Zapne alebo vypne zobrazenie čiar markerov a miniatúr"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:226
msgid ""
"Selecting this allows you to view all the video tracks at once in a split "
"screen in the project monitor. Kdenlive starts with video track #1 in the "
"top left corner and displays the other tracks sequentially. Hidden tracks "
"are not displayed."
msgstr ""
"Výberom tejto možnosti môžete zobraziť všetky video stopy naraz v rozdeľenej "
"obrazovke v monitore projektu. Kdenlive začína s video stopou č. 1 v ľavom "
"hornom rohu a ďalšie stopy zobrazuje postupne. Skryté stopy sa nezobrazujú."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/project_monitor.rst:228
msgid ""
"For more details about how to use this in Editing refer to the :ref:"
"`multicam_tool` chapter."
msgstr ""
"Ďalšie podrobnosti o použití pri editácii nájdete v kapitole :ref:"
"`multicam_tool`."
